===persian===

چشمانم را بستم
تا تو را عاشقانه ببوسم
بمب افتاد...
مرغابی ها پریدند
چشم گشودم
تو،
در آغوش دیگری بودی...
های... جنگ...

۱۳۶۳

===machine===

I closed my eyes
To kiss you lovingly
The bomb dropped...
The ducks jumped
I opened my eyes
so,
You were in someone else's arms...
hi... war...

1363

===lantern===

I closed my eyes
to kiss you the way lovers do —
then the bomb fell.
The wild ducks scattered.
I opened my eyes:
you
were already in another's arms...

Ah... war...

===translation===

I closed my eyes
to kiss you as lovers do 
the bomb fell...
the ducks scattered...

I opened my eyes:

there

you were - 
already in another's arms

... Oy... uh... war

